        "publishTime": "2022-06-12T10:32:18.463718Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPa2JUNHNRRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPa2JUNHNRRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401aab72230d3:0x4bcdc1f048418800"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ0zAit6oBBDQRAIhBSPDBzUs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xck5VZDFVa3A0Wkd0NlMxWmhjelZtZUV0UE1uYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "Preface是一家集教育和商務於一體的中心，在香港各地開設了幾家咖啡館和葡萄酒吧，包括位於銅鑼灣謝斐道535大廈總部內的那家。咖啡館位於大樓一層，一進門就能看到，每天早上8:30至晚上7:00營業。\n\n店內設有工作桌和開放式座位，提供豐富的黑咖啡、白咖啡、非咖啡飲品和葡萄酒，您可以在舒適的空調環境中享用。\n\n我最近去那裡喝了一杯小杯咖啡（piccolo），咖啡師在酒吧精心製作，味道很棒。濃縮咖啡的風味濃鬱，牛奶的加入恰到好處，口感柔和，是一款不錯的白咖啡。這次體驗很棒，以後還會再去這家Preface咖啡館喝咖啡。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Preface is a educational and business centre that has opened a few coffee & wine shops around the city including at their HQ at the Tower 535 building on Jaffe Road in Causeway Bay. The coffee shop is located immediately as you enter their facility at street level and open from 8.30am to 7pm daily.\n\nYou'll find work space tables along with open seating along with a simple list of black and white coffees, non-coffee drinks and wine you can order and enjoy in A/C temperature controlled environs.\n\nI recently stopped by and was served a good piccolo, nicely prepared by the barista at the counter. Espresso flavour came through, enough milk added to cut the edge, making for a nice white coffee drink. Will gladly return for another coffee at this Preface location based on this experience.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "BradinHK",
